  "description": "BLOKES on BLOCKS! is a fast-paced action party game for up to 6 players that anyone can jump into with simple controls!\nChoose your favourite bloke and send the other blokes flying!\n\n【Game Features】\n▼ Simple Controls\nMovement is all you need—up, down, left, and right.\nCrash into other players to knock them down,\nthen crash into them again to send them flying.\nIt’s a simple, straight-up competitive game built entirely around movement and collisions.\n\n▼ Chaotic Multiplayer Fun\nPick up items to crank up the chaos in battle—press the A button to use them!\nBombs, missiles, beams and more turn every match into total mayhem.\nFast, chaotic matches make it easy to jump in anytime, even if you only have a few minutes to play.\n\n【Game Modes】\n▼ Last Stand\nSurvive to the very end!\nA life-based battle mode where you respawn quickly, even after being knocked out.\nEven after losing all your lives, you can still attack from outside and interfere with the battle—\na loud, chaotic mode that stays exciting until the very last moment.\n\n▼ Chip Rush\nCollect chips and claim victory!\nGather chips scattered across the stage or steal them from other players to compete for the win.\nNear the end of the match, the Piggy Bank appears, opening up a huge chance for a last-second comeback!\n\n▼ Sudden Smash\nGet knocked down, and it’s instant KO!?\nA high-risk, round-based battle where every smash is a one-hit finisher.\nSend your opponents flying, rack up points and aim for first place!",
